<title>MEXICO: Mexico's Pemex reports Q1 expenditures.</title>
<headline>Mexico's Pemex reports Q1 expenditures.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's oil and gas monopoly Petroleos Mexicanos (Pemex) reported its capital and exploratory expenditures exercised in the first quarter. Figures in millions of dollars.</p>
<p>    Item	   Q1 1996 Expenses    Q1 1997 Expenses</p>
<p>Total			     473		     561</p>
<p>Exploration &amp; Production    296		     394</p>
<p>Refining &amp; Marketing	  156		     107</p>
<p>Natural Gas, NGL		 11			43</p>
<p>Chemicals			   5			13</p>
<p>Other				 5			 3</p>
<p>((--Timna Tanners, Mexico City newsroom +525 728 7903)).</p>
</text>
